{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"1997年11月9日上海“广洋杯”第二届象棋大棋圣战，卜凤波大师以“双炮轰卒”的最新战术战胜了特级大师柳大华，使这一战术刹那间声名鹊起。尤其是以“东方电脑”著称的柳大华竟然遭此病毒侵袭而没有御敌之策，从而为这一战术披上一层神秘的面纱。这种高效新式武器的推出，无疑是在上海滩的上空爆炸了一颗“象棋氢弹”而令棋界震惊。当蘑菇云尚未散尽之际，笔者收到了远方棋友的长途：“东方电脑对这种战术都没办法。难道屏风马从此再也不能下了吗？”\r\n为了揭开这一战术神秘的面纱，让我们首先拉开历史的长镜头来看看当初卜凤波——柳大华实战全局：","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2a6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e6","comment":"为了区别于五九炮打中卒其他战术，笔者拟称现在中炮打卒为“五九炮双炮轰卒”。双炮轰卒是80年代出现的战术，90年代比较少见，但卜凤波大师对此却情有独钟，并在一些重大比赛中屡建奇功。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2e1","comment